  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"由 Serilum 開發的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「可繁殖的殺手兔」是一款極簡且可配置的模組，讓玩家能透過繁殖獲得殺手兔。當兩隻普通兔子繁殖時，有機率會生成一隻殺手兔。<strong>請小心，它可能會攻擊你！</strong></span><br><br></p>\n<p>想了解關於該生物的更多資訊，請點<strong><span style=\"color:#f90\"><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fRabbit%2523The_Killer_Bunny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></span></strong>。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceBabyRabbitIsKiller&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 0.05，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">幼兔為殺手兔變種的機率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>removeKillerRabbitNameTag</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">移除幼殺手兔名稱標籤中的「The Killer Bunny」字樣。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>自版本 1.1 起，殺手兔現在可以使用金胡蘿蔔進行馴服：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/breedable-killer-rabbit/a.png\" alt=\"1\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"></strong><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/breedable-killer-rabbit/b.png\" alt=\"2\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/breedable-killer-rabbit/c.png\" alt=\"3\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/breedable-killer-rabbit/d.png\" alt=\"4\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽與更多詳細資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在多個獨立的模組頁面上追蹤評論，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
